    "API Key": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "API Key 仅保存在本机私有凭据文件中；点击同步后会复制到你的 Passport。测试和对话会产生供应商 API 用量。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys stay in your private local credentials file and are copied to your Passport only when you sync. Tests and conversations incur provider API usage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 只保存在本机。使用云端识别时，录音会发送到该服务商的服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your API key stays on this Mac. With cloud recognition, your audio is sent to this provider's servers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 无效或没有权限（HTTP %lld）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
