    "Apple Speech 不支持%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Speech doesn't support %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Speech 与云端流式服务的字幕延迟最低；其他本地模型按句识别，准确率更高。模型在[识别模型](vibekey-settings://models)里下载，云端服务也在那里配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Speech and cloud streaming services give the lowest caption latency. Other local models transcribe sentence by sentence for higher accuracy. Download models and set up cloud services in [Speech Models](vibekey-settings://models)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Azure AI Translator，稳定、免费额度大": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Azure AI Translator: reliable, generous free tier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
