    "FoloToy AI Passport 是 FoloVibe Key 的硬件搭档：按住说话、一键发送，Agent 完成时提醒你。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FoloToy AI Passport is FoloVibe Key's hardware companion: hold to talk, send with one key, and get notified when an agent finishes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FoloVibe Key": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "FoloVibe Key 不保存字幕历史：记录只在内存中，下次开始字幕或退出后清除。结束字幕后会打开字幕记录窗口，可以在那里查看、翻译、总结和保存；字幕进行中可以点字幕条上的 %@ 打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FoloVibe Key doesn't keep caption history: the transcript lives in memory only and is cleared when you start captions again or quit. When captions end, the Transcript window opens so you can review, translate, summarize, and save it. While captions are running, click %@ on the caption bar to open it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FoloVibe Key 有新版本": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A new version of FoloVibe Key is available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FoloVibe Key 还没有退出（例如实时字幕还在进行）。处理好后点「继续安装」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FoloVibe Key hasn't quit yet (for example, live captions are still running). After handling it, click Continue Installation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
