            "value": "Kimi did not accept the message. Check the original session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kimi 未能附着原会话；可能被其他进程占用，不会自动夺取": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unable to attach to the original Kimi session. It may be in use by another process; it will not be taken over automatically."
