    "按住 OK 说话，松开发送；上键提交助手草稿，下键停止，长按下键选择云对话或应用会话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold OK to talk and release to send. Press Up to submit an assistant draft, Down to stop, or hold Down to choose cloud chat or an app session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按住 OK 键说话，松开转写；上键发送当前 Codex 输入框，下键停止任务，长按上键切换模式；录音时长按下键取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold OK to talk and release to transcribe. Up sends the current Codex input, Down stops the task, and holding Up switches modes. Hold Down while recording to cancel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按住「听写」快捷键说话，松开后先润色再输入。AI 会参考[词汇表](vibekey-settings://vocabulary)纠正专有名词。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold the Dictate shortcut and speak; on release the text is polished, then typed. The AI uses your [vocabulary](vibekey-settings://vocabulary) to correct names and terms."
          }
        }
