            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last seen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最多保存 4 个网络。首次添加请保留 USB；长按 ▲ 约 1 秒切换听写、翻译和字幕，继续按住到约 2.5 秒切换网络或蓝牙。蓝牙模式或离线时长按 ▼ 也可打开网络列表。密码只经 USB 发给设备。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Up to 4 networks can be saved. Keep USB connected for the first setup. Long-press ▲ for about 1 second to switch between dictation, translation and subtitles; keep holding until about 2.5 seconds to switch networks or Bluetooth. In Bluetooth mode or offline, long-press ▼ to open the network list. Passwords are sent to the device over USB only."
