            "value": "Weekly quota"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每场字幕默认不翻译：点字幕条上的「译」开始翻译，再点一次关闭；「译」旁的箭头可以换语言。字幕条上的翻译方式菜单改的也是这里。在线服务和语言包在[翻译服务](vibekey-settings://translation)里配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captions start untranslated each time: click Translate on the caption bar to start translating and click it again to stop; use the arrow next to Translate to switch languages. The translation method menu on the caption bar changes this same setting. Online services and language packs are set up in [Translation Services](vibekey-settings://translation)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
