    },
    "每月前 50 万字符免费（需要开通结算）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First 500K characters free each month (billing required)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每行一个词。可用「正式写法 = 常见误识别」指定纠正，例如 DeepSeek = DIPSEEK, deep seek, 迪普希克。识别后立即替换，不增加出字延迟；Whisper 和 Apple Speech 也会参考正式写法。点「载入推荐词汇」会追加 AI、产品、设计、前后端、电影、历史、地理等常用词，不会删除已有内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One term per line. Use \"preferred = common mishearing\" to add corrections, e.g. DeepSeek = DIPSEEK, deep seek, 迪普希克. Corrections apply instantly with no extra latency; Whisper and Apple Speech also use the preferred spelling. Click Load Recommended Terms to append common words from AI, product, design, frontend/backend, film, history and geography without deleting anything you've added."
          }
        }
      }
    },
