    "设备端：长按 ▲ 约 1 秒切换听写、翻译和字幕，继续到约 2.5 秒打开网络列表；蓝牙模式或离线时长按 ▼ 也可打开。短按上下选择，短按 OK 切换；最后一项 USE BLUETOOTH 可直接切蓝牙。长按 OK 返回。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the device: long-press ▲ for about 1 second to switch between dictation, translation and subtitles; keep holding until about 2.5 seconds to open the network list. In Bluetooth mode or offline, long-press ▼ to open it too. Use ▲/▼ to select and tap OK to switch; the last item, USE BLUETOOTH, switches directly to Bluetooth. Long-press OK to go back."
