        }
      }
    },
    "配网时请先通过 USB 连接设备": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect the device over USB to set up Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配网未确认，请保持 USB 连接后重试": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi setup wasn't confirmed. Keep USB connected and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配置 AI 服务…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set Up AI Service…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配置 WorkBuddy Hook": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure WorkBuddy hooks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配置…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配置好的服务会出现在[听写](vibekey-settings://dictation)、[实时字幕](vibekey-settings://subtitles)的「翻译方式」和字幕条的翻译方式菜单里。密钥只保存在本机；使用在线服务时，要翻译的文字会发送到该服务商。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configured services appear in the Translation Method menus under [Dictation](vibekey-settings://dictation) and [Live Captions](vibekey-settings://subtitles), and on the caption bar. Keys are stored only on this Mac; with online services, the text being translated is sent to that provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配置文件格式不受支持，已保留原文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The configuration format is unsupported. The original file has been preserved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
