          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音频格式不正确": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsupported audio format"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "页面打开时自动检测，能力以原应用实际回执为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detects automatically while this page is open. Capabilities depend on actual app responses."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "额度已用完或账户欠费（%@）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quota exhausted or unpaid balance (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次同步凭据请使用 USB；后续可用已配对的加密 Wi-Fi。独立模式在 Mac 关闭后仍可进行云端语音对话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use USB for the first credential sync. Later updates can use paired encrypted Wi-Fi. Standalone cloud conversations continue when the Mac is off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次安装请选择当前 WorkBuddy 版本使用的 Hook JSON；此后记住位置，合并安装并保留备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the first installation, select the hook JSON used by your WorkBuddy version. Its location is remembered; installation merges changes and keeps a backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
